# suite TSORESV sales reservation
ok 1 - sales demand always reserves as SALESORDER
ok 2 - the demand reference is the order number
ok 3 - the demand line is the order line number
ok 4 - a missing item is refused, never guessed
ok 5 - a missing item reports SRV0001
ok 6 - a zero quantity cannot be reserved
ok 7 - a reservation must name its demand
ok 8 - nothing was reserved by a rejected request
ok 9 - an unknown function is refused with 08
ok 10 - an unknown function reports SRV0008
ok 11 - an unknown demand holds no reservations
ok 12 - AC-043 a reservation is granted
ok 13 - AC-043 free stock falls by exactly what was taken
ok 14 - AC-043 the reservation has an identity
ok 15 - AC-043 the reservation is active
ok 16 - AC-043 a competing order cannot take reserved units
ok 17 - AC-043 the shortfall is reported, not hidden
ok 18 - AC-043 a partial allocation warns with SRV0003
ok 19 - shelf life is tested 30 days after despatch
ok 20 - a released reservation reports RELEASED
ok 21 - revalidation answers 00 or 06, never silently 08
1..21
# TSORESV sales reservation passed 00021 failed 00000
# exit 0
